y.\n\nB: very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, excellent computer skills, but regarded as pretentious, sometimes adopts wrong tone. Conscientious and stress resilience good, but communication tone issues.\n\nC: can make correct decisions quickly, difficulty communicating ideas, regarded as egocentric, not willing to further education, puts concern for others above everything, excellent attention skills. Decision quality good, attention good, but communication issues, egocentric, not willing to develop.\n\nD: responds to unexpected events adequately, can concentrate very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, considered moody, regarded as loner. Good problem solving, responsibility, concentration, but moody and loner may affect crew cooperation.\n\nWe need to pick best overall fit. Likely B seems strong on reliability, stress, technical (computer), but communication tone issues. A strong on anticipation and leadership but unfriendly. C strong on decision and attention but communication and egocentric. D strong on problem solving and responsibility but moody/loner.\n\nWhich candidate has most balanced strengths with fewer serious concerns? B: conscientious (reliability), handles stress (stress resilience), good weather assessment (technical), computer skills (technical). Communication issues: pretentious, wrong tone. Could be mitigated with training. A: unfriendly may affect crew cooperation heavily. D: moody/loner may affect crew cooperation. C: egocentric, communication difficulty, not willing to further education (development). So B seems best overall.\n\nThus I will recommend Candidate B, noting strengths and concerns.\n\nWe need to output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate B\"."}
